stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: gateway escalates call<br/>(REQUIRE_APPROVAL)
  Pending --> Approved: approver approves
  Pending --> Denied: approver denies
  Pending --> Expired: timeout (default 120 s)
  Pending --> Cancelled: agent session closed
  Approved --> [*]: call executed
  Denied --> [*]: call blocked
  Expired --> [*]: call blocked (fail-safe)
  Cancelled --> [*]
